        "notes": "USGS false-color mosaic: near-infrared, green and violet color ratios combined with observed monochrome detail. USGS corrected broad limb darkening and matched image seams. Source color detail varies from 1.3 to 21 km per pixel. Interpolated polar color is withheld; observed monochrome remains where available. Gray grid marks missing imagery. Acquisition shading, seams and changes between mission dates can remain; globe lighting is approximate.",
